description: Rules for data layer, repository implementations, DTO and datasources
globs: lib/*/data/**/*.dart
alwaysApply: false
---
# Data Layer

- Never import application or ux layer files.
- Every DTO must use `freezed` + `json_serializable`.
- Every datasource must implement the interface defined in `data/`.
- Every repository must implement the interface defined in `domain/`.
- Never expose Firebase-specific types outside the data layer.